      "service": "workflow",
      "kind": "bad_deploy",
      "mechanism": "Deploy v1.1.1 at t=458 introduced a feature flag that causes workflow to generate orders with incorrect invoice data (violating VAT calculation rules), which then propagate through the system.",
      "supporting": ["E2", "E7", "E15", "E35", "E36"],
      "refuting": ["E18", "E19", "E20"],
      "explains": ["I3_ledger_integrity"],
      "repair_plan": [
        {"action": "rollback_service", "params": {"service": "workflow"}},
        {"action": "resync_ledger", "params": {}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "service": "worker",
      "kind": "resource_exhaustion",
      "mechanism": "Increased order creation rate (E7) starting at t=540 overwhelmed worker capacity, causing queue buildup (E11) and worker restarts (E12, E14), leading to orphaned orders.",
      "supporting": ["E1", "E6", "E11", "E12", "E14"],
      "refuting": ["E20"],
      "explains": ["I2_no_orphaned_orders"],
      "repair_plan": [
        {"action": "restart_service", "params": {"service": "worker"}},
        {"action": "requeue_orphaned_orders", "params": {}}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Two independent root causes: workflow deploy introduced bad invoice data, and worker resource exhaustion caused order processing delays."
}
